{"title":"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_AliceWang\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by AliceWang</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, shown in the Venn diagram, have the same number of elements.\nTheir union has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0db9f93bcba529c93ae151a1ac5c740eec7cca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" /> elements and their intersection has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888c508062c09735bab7ff0e11e7dc80cc7580db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> elements. Find\nthe number of elements in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfdb09b66054973cff11a173317d646fe1d66de1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)); draw(Circle(origin, 5)); draw(Circle((5,0), 5)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, (0,5), N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, (5,5), N); label(&quot;$1001$&quot;, (2.5, -0.5), N);[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"192\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/3/1334902d6fadf3a87fc46289fe3c3807443a5606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 503 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 1006 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 1504 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 1507 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 1510$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"469\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of elements in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> which is equal. \n</p><p>Then we could form equation \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b98109b6cb2c0bb260b0eaa953d965cbf2b62a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x-1001 = 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"138\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/359c2bfca2777ef0d952dfe9eeceec14b2652be7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 3008$\" width=\"79\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/a/5fa0800d6bb850e262f9b51ea15b945901a7ff45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1504$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/8/438a9c2d05f200155cfb50d22f7e7c515f70e72f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1504}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"82\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of elements in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> not including the intersection. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1b82ed0744065ee9470c630e7944378b0afbf2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007-1001=1006$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"15\" /> total elements excluding the intersection. Since we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be115227b05ea0768ff45f7217aaf3c195892aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=B$\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, we can find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8dea67083982076b4bf8206f5d71925ce38df12c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{1006}2=503$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"38\" />. Now we need to add the intersection. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2c9ce7f91752cde1117447f191b07968e94241e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$503+1001=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} 1504}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3LtGb3KjhoU\">https://youtu.be/3LtGb3KjhoU</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6F9x1XBOAeo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6F9x1XBOAeo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_AliceWang\">Video Solution by AliceWang</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by AliceWang\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ThBO09fGBgM\">https://youtu.be/ThBO09fGBgM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 8\">2007 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2007\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">Proble